msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji...... Honestly, you've brought up＿nothing but boring stuff.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji...... Sinceramente, solo＿has sacado temas aburridos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, my bad.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, culpa mía.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's fine. Just means your memory＿holes have been filled, right?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está bien. Solo significa que los huecos＿de tu memoria se llenaron, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess so.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo que sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Alright, time for a reward. I'll give＿you this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Bueno, hora de la recompensa.＿Te daré esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What is it?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué es?」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't you recognize it? It's the same＿as the one at my place.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No lo reconoces? Es igual＿al que tengo en mi casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Feels vaguely familiar.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me resulta vagamente familiar.」"

msgid "Taiga「It was sitting all by itself on a shelf at＿the general store. And it was SUPER＿cheap since it's out of season.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Estaba solito en un estante del＿bazar. Y estaba SÚPER barato porque＿está fuera de temporada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What do you mean, \"final blow\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿A qué te refieres con \"golpe final\"?」"

msgid "Taiga「Crush it to pieces and, hmmm, sprinkle＿them in a river, perhaps?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Hacerlo pedazos y, mmm, esparcirlos＿en un río, ¿quizás?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's why you bought it? MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Para eso lo compraste?＿¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Taiga「Heh, I thought you'd say that. So why＿don't you take it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Je, sabía que dirías eso. Entonces,＿¿por qué no te lo quedas tú?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In that case, I will.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En ese caso, lo acepto.」"

msgid "Taiga「Now then, I've gotta get going.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, ya me tengo que ir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you're not going home yet?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, todavía no te vas a casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I still have some shopping to do, so you＿go on without me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Todavía tengo compras que hacer,＿así que vete sin mí.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. And thanks.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Y gracias.」"

msgid "Taiga「You owe me one! Bye.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Me debes una! Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wow, she really seems to be handling＿herself just fine......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Vaya, de verdad parece que se las＿arregla muy bien sola......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, I'm not lonely or anything!＿Absolutely not!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡No, no me siento solo＿ni nada! ¡Para nada!）」"

msgid "Taiga「I was pretty curious, and it seemed to＿be living a miserable life, so I felt kinda＿upset, or maybe just sad...... Then I」"
msgstr "Taiga「Me dio curiosidad, y parecía llevar una＿vida miserable, así que me dio rabia, o＿tal vez tristeza...... Y entonces」"

msgid "Taiga「thought, why don't I deliver the final＿blow myself?」"
msgstr "Taiga「pensé: ¿por qué no darle el＿golpe final yo misma?」"
